          "lang_word": "fraud",
          "definition": "n. 欺詐、詐騙、舞弊、騙子（亦可指冒牌貨）"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "Bank investigators traced the fraud abroad, freezing accounts in four jurisdictions.",
