        {
          "en": "Several wire frauds were lined up for prosecution this quarter.",
          "highlight": [
            "frauds"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "本季已排定起訴好幾起電匯詐欺。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Because of her role in the fraud, the chief accountant was dismissed without severance.",
          "highlight": [
            "fraud"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "因為在這次舞弊中的角色，總會計被免職且未發遣散費。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
